  ($qb$S06C08Q02$qb$, $qb$S06$qb$, $qb$C08$qb$, $qb$L+MM+E$qb$, $qb$Non-financial recognition for high performance (public recognition, career opportunity, autonomy) in your organisation is:$qb$, $qb$Active and valued — non-financial recognition is a deliberate part of the performance culture$qb$, $qb$Present but inconsistent — some non-financial recognition happens but without a systematic approach$qb$, $qb$Rare — non-financial recognition is not a management practice$qb$, $qb$Non-existent — performance is rewarded financially or not at all; non-financial recognition does not occur$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
