  ($qb$S06C08Q06$qb$, $qb$S06$qb$, $qb$C08$qb$, $qb$L+MM+E$qb$, $qb$The timeliness of recognition in your organisation (how quickly achievement is acknowledged) is:$qb$, $qb$Immediate or near-immediate — recognition happens when it is most impactful$qb$, $qb$Within a few days — recognition is prompt enough to remain meaningful$qb$, $qb$Delayed — recognition frequently comes weeks after the achievement$qb$, $qb$Very delayed or absent — recognition often comes at formal review time, long after the achievement$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
