  ($qb$S08C05Q07$qb$, $qb$S08$qb$, $qb$C05$qb$, $qb$L+MM$qb$, $qb$Referral rates (existing employees recommending the organisation to their network) in your organisation are:$qb$, $qb$High — employee referrals are a significant talent source, indicating strong internal advocacy$qb$, $qb$Moderate — some referrals are generated but it is not a primary talent channel$qb$, $qb$Low — few employees actively refer candidates to the organisation$qb$, $qb$Very low — employees actively avoid recommending the organisation to their networks$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
