  ($qb$S08C05Q09$qb$, $qb$S08$qb$, $qb$C05$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$The organisation's ranking as an employer in its talent market (Best Employer awards, talent surveys) is:$qb$, $qb$Strong — the organisation is recognised as a top employer in its sector or geography$qb$, $qb$Adequate — the organisation is not notably recognised but not negatively perceived$qb$, $qb$Not tracked — employer ranking is not measured$qb$, $qb$Poor — the organisation is not competitive as an employer in its talent market$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
