  ($qb$S10C03Q06$qb$, $qb$S10$qb$, $qb$C03$qb$, $qb$L+MM+E$qb$, $qb$In your organisation, the pricing position and value defensibility relative to competitors is:$qb$, $qb$Excellent — pricing is premium and defensible — backed by demonstrable customer value$qb$, $qb$Adequate — pricing is broadly at market without a strong premium or discount position$qb$, $qb$Weak — the organisation competes primarily on price — margin is consistently under pressure$qb$, $qb$Very poor — the organisation discounts heavily to compete, destroying profitability$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
