  ($qb$S10C07Q09$qb$, $qb$S10$qb$, $qb$C07$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$In your organisation, the overall stakeholder perception across all key groups is:$qb$, $qb$Excellent — strong stakeholder relationships across all groups support the organisation's strategy$qb$, $qb$Adequate — stakeholder relationships are managed adequately without exceptional strength$qb$, $qb$Weak — notable stakeholder relationship gaps create strategic vulnerability$qb$, $qb$Very poor — weak or damaged stakeholder relationships are creating significant strategic risk$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
