  ($qb$S10C09Q03$qb$, $qb$S10$qb$, $qb$C09$qb$, $qb$L+MM+E$qb$, $qb$In your organisation, the recovery when things go wrong is:$qb$, $qb$Excellent — problems are resolved quickly, generously, and in a way that often increases customer loyalty$qb$, $qb$Adequate — problems are resolved professionally and fairly$qb$, $qb$Weak — problems are resolved but without the care to turn failures into positive experiences$qb$, $qb$Very poor — the organisation's response to service failures often makes the situation worse$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
